Usage: init <SHELL>

Print the script that hooks this command into your shell

Arguments
┌──┬─────────────────┬──┬────────────────────────────────────────┐
│  ┆ [bash|zsh|fish] ┆  ┆ Shell to hook into: bash, zsh, or fish │
└──┴─────────────────┴──┴────────────────────────────────────────┘

